# Original game files never enter this repository (CLAUDE.md rule 18, U2). tools/check_no_originals.py
# checks the same list in CI, because a .gitignore can be bypassed with `git add -f`. The patterns
# are case-insensitive by character class, so `probe.Exe` and `probe.PNG` are caught too.
*.[eE][xX][eE]
*.[cC][oO][mM]
*.[dD][lL][lL]
*.[oO][vV][lL]
*.[hH][lL][pP]
*.[cC][nN][tT]
*.[zZ][iI][pP]
*.[iI][sS][oO]
*.[iI][mM][gG]
*.[vV][hH][dD]
# Director Xtras are DLLs and carry the game's executable code.
*.[xX]32
originals/
# Runtime state stays on the machine.
prefix/
*.wineprefix/
dosbox-mount/
# Evidence media go to the experiment's release as bundles, never into git (05 §4).
*.[sS][aA][vV]
*.[pP][nN][gG]
*.[mM][pP]4
*.[wW][aA][vV]
# Agent worktrees under .claude/worktrees/ are nested checkouts; one `git add -A` would stage them.
.claude/worktrees/
# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
